    "retired": "code words for it that are gone and stay gone; `keep` lists the tokens that may still carry the letters (another thing's name)",
    "spellings_gone": "ways of writing its name that stay out of every file a person reads, matched as written; `spellings_kept` lists what a program must find spelled that way (a file's name, a scheduled task, a taskbar identity)"
